    {
      "name": "dsh-procedures",
      "title": {
        "en": "Experience Cards",
        "zh": "经验卡库"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "Turn repeated agent mistakes into small cards. A hit injects only a one-line pointer and is resolved locally — on a hit, roughly 83–90% fewer tokens — with a community card library you can pull from and contribute to. The resident hook costs about 440 tokens per turn; card bodies load on demand.",
        "zh": "把 agent 反复踩的坑变成小卡片；命中一张时只注入一行提示、由钩子本地解决，约省 83%~90% token；社区卡库可拉取、可贡献。常驻钩子约 440 token/轮，卡片正文按需读取。"
      },
      "author": "fubai-fenzhi",
      "homepage": "https://github.com/fubai-fenzhi/dsh-procedures#readme",
