    {
      "name": "@fubai-fenzhi/dsh-qqmail",
      "title": {
        "en": "QQ Mail",
        "zh": "QQ 邮箱"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "Read, search, file, mark read, deduplicate, and send a QQ mailbox over IMAP/SMTP. Rule-based archiving previews every move first, and the send tool previews the rendered mail before it transmits.",
        "zh": "通过 IMAP/SMTP 管理 QQ 邮箱：查看、搜索、按规则归档、标记已读、去重和发信。归档与发信默认只做预览，确认后才真正执行。"
      },
      "author": "fubai-fenzhi",
